  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nDear Committee.\r\n\r\nThe [HTML Living Standard](https://html.spec.whatwg.org) should be communicated on a website with acceptable loading times. \r\n\r\nAt present, it appears as though `https://html.spec.whatwg.org/` is the _single-page version_. Its **loading time** is **excessively long**. The waiting indicator is on most of the time and the browser repeatedly offers to abort the page. No good!\r\n\r\nIt would be wiser to make the _multi-page version_ the landing page of the site.\r\n**Please make browsing and working with the site a better experience.** \r\n\r\nAlso: a single-document _pdf file_ of over 1.500 pages (in a rather small typeface) is no great help! \r\nThanks for your consideration.",
